@api = http://localhost:5089
@token = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN

### Ćwiczenie 1: /health
GET {{api}}/health
X-Correlation-ID: example-123

### Ćwiczenie 3: Poprawny POST — 201
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "SomeStrongPassword123!"
}

### Logowanie JWT
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "SomeStrongPassword123!"
}

### Utworzenie notatki — 201 + Location
POST {{api}}/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Moja notatka",
  "body": "Przygotowana do testów"
}

### Niepoprawny POST — 400 ValidationProblem
POST {{api}}/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   ",
  "body": "Nieprawidłowy tytuł"
}

### Bez autoryzacji — 401
GET {{api}}/api/notes

### Moje notatki — 200
GET {{api}}/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nieistniejący zasób — 404
GET {{api}}/api/notes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
